    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44096" root="&#xA;                        نفى&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِعْلٌ مَنْفِىٌّ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>A verb rendered negative</i> by its
being preceded by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا</span> or the like; <i>contr. of</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثْبَتٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوجَبٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلاَمٌ مَنْفِىٌّ</span>
                        <i>A denied
sentence; contr. of</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُثْبَتٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوجَبٌ</span>; virtually
the same as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلاَمٌ نَافٍ</span>
                        <i>a denying,</i> or <i>negative,
sentence.</i>
